From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:26:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure cache allocation, pressure and resize
 diagnostics

Record script/signature cache whole-MiB allocation, requested budget and
capacity as unsigned integers. Preserve signed int64 coin-cache pressure
arithmetic and double-MiB resize expressions with the original .1f text.
Keep the CoinsTip configured budget separate from actual cache usage.
All cache construction, resizing, flushing, locks and returns are unchanged.

The native fixture constructs real ValidationCache and nested signature
caches, then verifies both actual events, integer budgets/capacity, Info
severity and exact readable formatting. Pressure/resize branches retain
reviewed expressions and are not newly forced by that fixture.
Tier: shared eCash, inherited unchanged by V2.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py==0.51.0; from the commit's parent):
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/runtime-cache-diagnostics.json --apply

